{
  "_comment": [
    "EXAMPLE FILE — this is the only google-services.json in the repository.",
    "Every real one is gitignored, so a fresh clone has no Firebase config at",
    "all and the Google Services Gradle plugin will fail the build until you",
    "add one. Copy this file's shape from the Firebase console:",
    "",
    "  TST:  Firebase console → exchangapay-tst  → Project settings → google-services.json",
    "  PROD: Firebase console → exchangapay-prod → Project settings → google-services.json",
    "",
    "File placement (the Google Services Gradle plugin picks these up automatically):",
    "  android/app/src/debug/google-services.json   ← tst project",
    "  android/app/src/release/google-services.json ← prod project",
    "  android/app/google-services.json             ← optional fallback",
    "",
    "All three paths are gitignored (.gitignore lines 146 and 148). Never commit",
    "a real one. The Gradle H-15 guard in android/app/build.gradle fails a",
    "production release build if the prod file is missing or still points at the",
    "tst project (exchangapay-tst-f570a)."
  ],
  "project_info": {
    "project_number": "REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_NUMBER",
    "project_id": "REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID",
    "storage_bucket": "REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID.firebasestorage.app"
  },
  "client": [
    {
      "client_info": {
        "mobilesdk_app_id": "REPLACE_WITH_MOBILESDK_APP_ID",
        "android_client_info": {
          "package_name": "REPLACE_WITH_PACKAGE_NAME"
        }
      },
      "oauth_client": [],
      "api_key": [
        {
          "current_key": "REPLACE_WITH_API_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "services": {
        "appinvite_service": {
          "other_platform_oauth_client": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "configuration_version": "1"
}
